{"id":"u-d866429c-3b2f-4e4d-8b67-4531ea85ead7","src":"community","title":"Russian Squat Routine","author":"Joel M.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/zcLJm7-russian-squat-routine","desc":"A high frequency, squat intensive routine designed to increase strength and proficiency. You can add exercises to these workouts, ideally some form of Olympic weightlifting.\n\nDeadlifting is hard while running this program. Instead focus on corrective exercises like back extensions, KB Swings etc. Don’t try to body build the legs either. You will likely grow due to the frequency and strength gains anyway. \n\nOn the last day you should hit 105% (maybe more) for a single but this wasn’t allowed to be input when writing the program. \n\nThe 6x2 days are your recovery days so take them easy and move well. \n\nEnjoy!","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Strength","Olympic Weightlifting"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":87,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-02T08:29:05.922Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":85,"x":5}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":90,"x":4}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":80,"x":6}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":95,"x":3}]}]}